{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20121","headline":"溧阳唐兴寺观蔷薇花同诸公饯陈明府 · 孟郊","name":"溧阳唐兴寺观蔷薇花同诸公饯陈明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽惊红琉璃，千艳万艳开。\n佛火不烧物，净香空徘徊。\n花下印文字，林间咏觞杯。\n羣官饯宰官，此地车马来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20121.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20121","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}